      "updated": 1785944848478,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n• Submit prompt/model/count/size/seed/style\n• Progressive status + resumable updates\n• Cancel queued and running jobs\n• Automatic transient retries + manual retry\n• Browsable/filterable paginated history\n• Prompt and output moderation\n• Quotas, rate limits, cost attribution\n• Secure asset viewing/download",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r2",
      "originalText": "FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n• Submit prompt/model/count/size/seed/style\n• Progressive status + resumable updates\n• Cancel queued and running jobs\n• Automatic transient retries + manual retry\n• Browsable/filterable paginated history\n• Prompt and output moderation\n• Quotas, rate limits, cost attribution\n• Secure asset viewing/download",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
