      "updated": 1785944846502,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n• Durable accepted jobs\n• p95 submit < 300 ms\n• status propagation ~1 s\n• independently scalable API / events / GPU\n• at-most-one logical job per idempotency scope\n• at-least-once queue + idempotent workers\n• tenant isolation and private assets\n• graceful reconnect, retries, and regional recovery",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r4",
      "originalText": "NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n• Durable accepted jobs\n• p95 submit < 300 ms\n• status propagation ~1 s\n• independently scalable API / events / GPU\n• at-most-one logical job per idempotency scope\n• at-least-once queue + idempotent workers\n• tenant isolation and private assets\n• graceful reconnect, retries, and regional recovery",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
