      "versionNonce": 1204829160,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785945098966,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Queue + GPU Workers\n\n- Durable priority queue, at-least-once delivery\nConditional lease acquisition prevents duplicate\nexecution\n- Scheduler partitions by model/GPU/tier\nHeartbeat + expiry recover crashed workers\nDLQ and bounded retries prevent poison loops.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r129",
      "originalText": "Queue + GPU Workers\n\n- Durable priority queue, at-least-once delivery\nConditional lease acquisition prevents duplicate execution\n- Scheduler partitions by model/GPU/tier\nHeartbeat + expiry recover crashed workers\nDLQ and bounded retries prevent poison loops.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
