      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785946051021,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Blob + CDN\n\n-Private staging upload → output moderation →\napproved metadata commit\n-Serve versioned assets through signed CDN access\n-Lifecycle cleanup for partial, blocked, deleted, and\nexpired files\n- Do not store image bytes in relational DB.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r131",
      "originalText": "Blob + CDN\n\n-Private staging upload → output moderation → approved metadata commit\n-Serve versioned assets through signed CDN access\n-Lifecycle cleanup for partial, blocked, deleted, and expired files\n- Do not store image bytes in relational DB.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "r133",
