      "text": "DISCUSSION CHECKLIST\n\n1. Clarify scale, safety, latency, history, privacy\n2. Establish durable asynchronous job model\n3. Define state machine and API semantics\n4. Explain idempotency and transactional outbox\n5. Draw queue, scheduler, leased GPU worker\n6. Explain resumable SSE and snapshot reconciliation\n7. Resolve queued/running cancellation races\n8. Cover retries, dedupe, moderation, quotas, cost\n9. Close with observability and reconciliation jobs",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r142",
      "originalText": "DISCUSSION CHECKLIST\n\n1. Clarify scale, safety, latency, history, privacy\n2. Establish durable asynchronous job model\n3. Define state machine and API semantics\n4. Explain idempotency and transactional outbox\n5. Draw queue, scheduler, leased GPU worker\n6. Explain resumable SSE and snapshot reconciliation\n7. Resolve queued/running cancellation races\n8. Cover retries, dedupe, moderation, quotas, cost\n9. Close with observability and reconciliation jobs",
